# Make a Stand: "Creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain indestructible until end of turn." On turn 2 Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt
# at Bot1's Memnite (1/1). In response Bot1 casts Make a Stand off Black Lotus: it resolves first, so the Memnite is a 2/1 with
# indestructible when the Bolt deals it 3 damage, which is lethal (the +1/+0 leaves its toughness at 1) but does not destroy it
# (CR 702.12b, 704.5g). The keyword and the damage are both gone on turn 3 (CR 514.2) and the Memnite is still there, a 1/1.

